{"2435000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hemobloom", "steam_appid": 2435000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror game where you explore a twisted realm of nightmares, confront grotesque monsters and piece together the mystery of the Hemobloom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A REALM OF NIGHTMARES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435000/extras/196b36272153e5ba09ee4479351755ed.poster.avif?t=1781516322\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435000/extras/196b36272153e5ba09ee4479351755ed.webm?t=1781516322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435000/extras/196b36272153e5ba09ee4479351755ed.mp4?t=1781516322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself stuck in a pocket dimension. Progress through the different layers of this nightmare to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFRONT GROTESQUE MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435000/extras/e62e1eb8e043c18fd0c798f3a6189ab7.poster.avif?t=1781516322\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435000/extras/e62e1eb8e043c18fd0c798f3a6189ab7.webm?t=1781516322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435000/extras/e62e1eb8e043c18fd0c798f3a6189ab7.mp4?t=1781516322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >U